  introduction: '## What is CodeRabbit?\n' +
    '\n' +
    'CodeRabbit is an AI-driven code review platform designed to automate and enhance the pull request (PR) review process for software engineering teams. By combining codebase intelligence, codegraphs, and multi-model AI exploration, CodeRabbit provides context-aware feedback, line-by-line recommendations, and automated risk scoring.\n' +
