    '- **PR Triage & Prioritization**: Automatically scores, ranks, and routes pull requests based on risk, effort, impact, and complexity to help developers manage large review queues efficiently.\n' +
    '- **Change Stack**: Offers interactive walkthroughs and explainability for complex diffs, including blast radius context and semantic architecture diagrams.\n' +
    '- **Agentic Code Security**: Continuously monitors codebases for security vulnerabilities, verifies findings to minimize false positives, and generates automated fix PRs.\n' +
    '- **Slack Integration**: Features a dedicated Slack agent to assist teams with incident response, support triage, and root cause analysis across merged PRs.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
