    '- **Managing High-Volume AI-Generated Code**: Helps engineering teams handle large diffs generated by AI coding tools with structured explainability and risk triage.\n' +
    '- **Continuous Security & Quality Enforcement**: Automatically enforces coding standards, checks PR checklists, and scans for dependency vulnerabilities on every commit.',
