    '- **Context Graphs:** Stitches context from multiple systems (ERP, CRM, SOPs, emails) to solve edge cases and follow complex business logic automatically.\n' +
    '- **Enterprise Controls & Security:** Offers SOC 2 Type II, ISO 27001, HIPAA, and GDPR compliance along with role-based access, SSO, full audit logs, and private cloud/on-prem deployment options.\n' +
    '- **Seamless Integrations:** Connects directly with tools like SAP, QuickBooks, Salesforce, HubSpot, Google Drive, Zendesk, and Snowflake.\n' +
    '- **Human-in-the-Loop Workflow:** Configurable approval gates route low-confidence or high-impact edge cases to human operators via Slack, Teams, or email.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Primary Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '- **Accounts Payable Automation:** Automates invoice ingestion, GL coding, 3-way matching, and ERP posting.\n' +
