fetchItem, url: https://openclaw.ai mergedData: {
  link: 'https://openclaw.ai',
  name: 'openclaw',
  description: 'OpenClaw is an open-source AI assistant that runs locally on your machine and integrates seamlessly with chat apps like WhatsApp, Telegram, and Discord.',
  introduction: '## What is OpenClaw?\n' +
    'OpenClaw is an open-source, self-hosted AI personal assistant that runs directly on your computer (macOS, Windows, or Linux) and connects to the messaging applications you use every day. Created by Peter Steinberger, OpenClaw acts as an autonomous digital employee capable of executing real system commands, browsing the web, managing schedules, and automating complex multi-step workflows.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Key Features\n' +
    '- **Local Execution & Privacy**: All agent state, memory, and personal context live on your local machine rather than in a vendor cloud.\n' +
    '- **Multi-Channel Messaging**: Chat with your AI assistant across 29 supported channels, including WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, Slack, iMessage, and Signal.\n' +
    '- **Full System Access & Sandboxing**: Read/write local files, run bash commands, execute scripts, and automate browser tasks in full or sandboxed mode.\n' +
    '- **Persistent Memory**: Retains user preferences, project context, and contact information across conversations and channels over time.\n' +
    '- **Extensible Skill System**: Expand capabilities using community plugins, custom extensions, or let OpenClaw write and register new skills autonomously.\n' +
    '- **Flexible Model Choice**: Works with API keys, subscription models (Claude, ChatGPT), or fully offline local LLM models.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Use Cases\n' +
    '- **Personal Operating System**: Manage inboxes, schedule calendar events, brief before meetings, and organize personal notes.\n' +
    '- **Developer & Code Automation**: Trigger background test runs, resolve bugs, review PRs, and manage GitHub issues directly from your phone.\n' +
    '- **Workflow Automation**: Build custom integrations for home automation, personal finance tracking, and multi-agent task execution.',
  categories: [ 'AI Tools', 'AI Chat', 'Developer Tools' ],
  tags: [
    'Open Source',
    'AI',
    'Chatbot',
    'Automation',
    'Coding',
    'Productivity'
  ],
  image: 'https://openclaw.ai/og-image.png',
  icon: 'https://icons.duckduckgo.com/ip3/openclaw.ai.ico'
}
