    '\n' +
    '## Key Features\n' +
    '- **Multi-Format Ingestion**: Transcribes and indexes YouTube videos, podcasts, PDFs, research papers, and audio recordings.\n' +
    '- **MCP Integration**: Connects knowledge pods directly to Claude, ChatGPT, and other MCP-enabled AI models for grounded responses.\n' +
    '- **Structured Deep Dives**: Extracted insights feature timestamped citations, key entities (books, companies, products), Q&A breakdowns, and structured data tables.\n' +
    '- **Versatile Summarization**: Provides 11 built-in summary templates, including Academic, Q&A, Deep Dive, and General summaries.\n' +
    '- **Multilingual Support**: Supports transcribing and translating media content in over 130 languages.\n' +
    '- **Grounded AI Chat**: Built-in chat functionality allows users to query entire pods with verified source citations.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Use Cases\n' +
    '- **Research & Study**: Analyze long lectures, conference talks, and academic papers with exact timestamped reference points.\n' +
    '- **Deal & Client Management**: Build dedicated pods for specific client assets, transcripts, and pitch decks to keep AI outputs aligned with brand guidelines.\n' +
    '- **Content Repurposing**: Quickly convert long-form video or audio recordings into structured summaries, key takeaway lists, or blog drafts.',
