    '- **Error Fixing & Auto-Formatting**: Identifies syntax issues, corrects dialect mismatches, and formats code for better readability.\n' +
    '- **Multi-Database Support**: Connects seamlessly with PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQL Server, Oracle, Snowflake, BigQuery, Redshift, MongoDB, SQLite, and Firebird.\n' +
    '- **Built-in Security**: Enforces read-only query execution by default to safeguard databases against unauthorized data modifications.\n' +
