    '- **Automated Prospect Hunting:** Scans SERPs and competitor backlinks to quickly identify relevant link-building opportunities.\n' +
    '- **AI Relevance Verdicts:** Analyzes candidate pages and assigns clear action verdicts (Keep, Drop, or Second look) along with detailed reasoning.\n' +
    '- **Contact Discovery:** Locates relevant editors, founders, or staff writers alongside verified email addresses and LinkedIn profiles.\n' +
    "- **Context-Aware Pitch Drafting:** Automatically drafts tailored outreach messages citing specific content on the prospect's website.\n" +
    '- **Flexible Automation Control:** Allows users to review every email before sending or switch to autopilot mode with custom pacing and send windows.\n' +
    '- **Link Monitoring:** Periodically re-checks earned backlinks and alerts users if a link goes missing or switches to nofollow.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Use Cases\n' +
