  name: 'berri ai',
  description: 'Berri AI enables developers to rapidly build, evaluate, and deploy production-ready ChatGPT applications backed by custom data sources via simple API endpoints.',
  introduction: 'Berri AI is a developer platform designed to rapidly create, evaluate, and deploy production-ready ChatGPT applications using custom data sources. By abstracting the complex retrieval and context-window engineering required for large language models, Berri AI allows developers to quickly integrate data from files, URLs, databases, and internal documentation into conversational AI interfaces.\n' +
    '\n' +
