    '- **Custom Data Integration**: Connect ChatGPT models to large datasets including files, URLs, Notion pages, and databases without manual context management.\n' +
    '- **REST API Endpoints**: Easily create templates, spin up app instances, query endpoints, update knowledge bases, fine-tune models, and manage lifecycle events.\n' +
    '- **Pre-built Use Case Presets**: Utilize specialized presets tailored for customer support bots, spreadsheet question-answering, and multi-prompt workflows.\n' +
    '- **Deployment & Embeds**: Seamlessly embed AI chatbots directly into websites or integrate them into team tools like Slack.\n' +
    '- **Advanced RAG Strategies**: Optimize QA accuracy with built-in custom chunking, evaluation suites, and multi-prompt classification techniques.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Primary Use Cases\n' +
    '- **Customer Support Automation**: Deploy AI agents equipped with company documentation to answer technical user queries.\n' +
    '- **Internal Knowledge Base QA**: Build interactive chatbots that query internal technical docs and product specifications.\n' +
    '- **Interactive Web Applications**: Embed custom ChatGPT assistants directly onto marketing sites or SaaS user dashboards.',
