    '- **Content Generation & Rewriting**: Write blog posts from scratch, import existing online content via URL for automated rewriting, or summarize long articles.\n' +
    '- **Customizable AI Prompts**: Tailor all underlying AI prompts to align with your specific content goals and brand voice.\n' +
    '- **Integrated SEO Tools**: Generate meta descriptions, summaries, and SEO-friendly headlines in a single click.\n' +
    '- **Multi-Language Support**: Create and translate blog posts across more than 10 popular languages.\n' +
    '- **Automatic Linking**: Automatically apply internal or external links within your generated posts to enhance workflow efficiency.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Target Audience & Use Cases\n' +
    'BloggerAI is ideal for bloggers, SEO professionals, digital marketers, and creative agencies looking to scale their content creation while maintaining control over AI prompts and API expenses.',
