    '- **Multi-Channel Integration:** Deploy AI agents across Website chat, WhatsApp, Facebook Messenger, Instagram, Telegram, SMS, and Slack.\n' +
    '- **Prompt-Based Agent Creation:** Build dynamic AI agents using natural language instructions and custom SOPs instead of complex flowchart trees.\n' +
    '- **5,000+ App Connections:** Connect agents natively or via Zapier to HubSpot, Google Drive, Shopify, Salesforce, and internal APIs.\n' +
