  introduction: 'Briefy is an AI-powered knowledge assistant designed to boost reading efficiency and simplify information management. Available as a browser extension across platforms like Chrome and Safari, Briefy enables users to digest lengthy articles, research papers, YouTube videos, PDFs, and email threads in seconds with a single click.\n' +
    '\n' +
