    '- **Multi-Format Summarization:** Effortlessly generate summaries for web pages, YouTube videos, PDFs, and Gmail threads.\n' +
    '- **Structured Summary Views:** View concise content overviews, structured tables, mind maps, or timelines tailored to your reading style.\n' +
    '- **Interactive Knowledge Base:** Save generated summaries into a searchable personal knowledge base where you can review, ask questions, or share insights.\n' +
    '- **Context-Aware AI QA:** Ask follow-up questions directly on summarized content or across your saved knowledge base to get instant context-aware answers.\n' +
    '- **Multilingual Support:** Translate and summarize content into your preferred language with inline translation capabilities.\n' +
    '\n' +
